rsonal favorite frankensnowball from here is creamy chocolate and almond mixed which totally tastes like snickers in a cup! Mommy notes: Gives plenty of napkins, outdoor picnic table for seating, clear flavors av..."},{"business_id":"UD75az_kM1vyrOCGrgGjmw","review_id":"0cBRQ5PGPA7d8j2U0RSDEA","date":"2019-06-29T14:09:04","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9398971796035767,"text_excerpt":"Their snowball ice is so smooth. There is never a line or huge wait. The different snowball flavors are delicious. The staff is very friendly. Highly recommend!"}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
